TEST_CASE_DESCRIPTION
On the partner port apply `no speed` and `duplex auto`. On the DUT test port apply `speed auto` and `duplex auto`. Poll status for up to 30 s, then read `show interface <test port>` and `show running-config interface <test port>`.
TEST_CASE_REFERENCES
AWPTCM-T33235, 9001.33235.27
TEST_CASE_METHOD
On the partner port apply `no speed` and `duplex auto`. On the DUT test port apply `speed auto` and `duplex auto`. Poll status for up to 30 s, then read `show interface <test port>` and `show running-config interface <test port>`.
Verify: The test port row reads `connected` with `a-` prefixed speed and duplex. The current line shows a concrete negotiated speed equal to the step-2 baseline, not the literal `auto`. Running-config contains no forced numeric `speed` value for the test port.

